 gui/freehand.py        |  3 +--
 gui/historypopup.py    |  3 +--
 gui/layermanip.py      |  3 +--
 gui/widgets.py         |  3 ++-
 gui/windowing.py       | 21 +++++++++++----------
 9 files changed, 30 insertions(+), 30 deletions(-)

